WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.810
Speaker 1: So the brains of maggots seem to
be breaking over this news story related to

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:11.210
some classified documents that were left behind
at an office of then Vice President Joe Biden.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:16.800
Now, I have made every effort, and it hasn't
been very difficult to be consistent about

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.510
this story.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.109
Donald Trump should have.

00:00:20.109 --> 00:00:24.320
And is it being investigated for his handling
