00:00:30.619 --> 00:00:33.070
And Joe Biden should likewise be investigated.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.380
Now, the circumstances, of course, are completely
different.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:39.310
We're talking about a couple about a dozen
or so documents with Joe Biden.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.910
And we're talking about, what, hundreds or
more with Trump.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:46.829
