where when his lawyers found out, they immediately

00:00:46.829 --> 00:00:50.790
notified the National Archives, it was the
opposite with Trump.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:56.250
There is no evidence whatsoever that Joe Biden
asked or was even involved in these documents

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.310
