00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:03.460
Whereas there is widespread testimony that
Donald Trump specifically said take these

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.040
documents down to Mar a Lago.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:08.470
There's there are no similarities, but I'm
consistent.

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:11.580
Investigate every one and everything and see
where it shakes out.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:16.470
Right wingers brains seemed to have been scrambled
by this.

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:23.140
Here is Ronny Jackson, who says he believes
these documents were found as part of a conspiracy

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:26.159
