00:01:26.159 --> 00:01:28.070
Speaker 2: And they could be happening here.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:31.119
Jean, is that I've been saying for a long
time that the Democrats are going to have

00:01:31.119 --> 00:01:32.990
