election.

00:01:38.119 --> 00:01:41.020
So I think, you know, a lot of people thought
it would be a cognitive issue.

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:42.610
You know, I thought so as well.

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:46.060
But I thought, well, maybe they won't go down
there because that's admitting defeat, that

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:50.000
