has to decide that he's not going to run again.

00:02:02.909 --> 00:02:03.909
Speaker 1: Yeah.

00:02:03.909 --> 00:02:08.209
Now, the reason this is very stupid is, of
course, number one, there's no evidence of

00:02:08.209 --> 00:02:09.209
that.

00:02:09.209 --> 00:02:11.720
But number two, it doesn't really make sense
because as I talked about at the top of the

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:19.660
show, why is Joe Biden a disaster in the sense
that in polling against Trump, Biden is mostly

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.660
